Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 02:40:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] feat(control-plane): serve the real API from the runnable
 entrypoint

The only runnable app still registered the phase-0 placeholder table, so every
business endpoint answered 501 while the implemented router was mounted only in
tests. The database path could not be configured at all.

Mount create_api_router(), open the SQLite registry in the FastAPI lifespan
from FORGEMESH_DB_PATH (no filesystem side effects at import), make /readyz
probe the registry, and read FORGEMESH_HOST/FORGEMESH_PORT, defaulting to
loopback until authentication exists.
